## Custom Themes with CSS

### Linking a custom stylesheet

```yaml
format:
  html:
    theme: flatly
    css: custom.css
```

### Useful CSS overrides for publication style

```css
/* custom.css */

/* Typography */
body {
  font-family: "Georgia", serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  max-width: 780px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* Figure captions */
.figure-caption, figcaption {
  font-size: 0.85em;
  color: #555;
  font-style: italic;
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 0.4em;
}

/* Table caption */
caption {
  font-weight: bold;
  text-align: left;
  margin-bottom: 0.5em;
}

/* Callout notes styled as journal "boxes" */
.callout-note {
  border-left: 4px solid #2c7bb6;
  background: #f0f7ff;
}

/* Reduce heading sizes for manuscript feel */
h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 0.2em; }
h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; }
```

